{# The wordmark, as text.

   Not the logo image: most clients block remote images by default, so a picture
   of the name arrives as an empty box or as alt text in whatever the client
   feels like — while the name itself always renders, in the right weight and
   colour, everywhere. #}
<tr>
    <td style="padding:0 8px 16px; font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif; font-size:20px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:-0.01em; color:#0b6b78;">
        {{ company.trading_name }}
    </td>
</tr>
